OL,4,CEighty tonnes of scrap metal catch     
OL,5,Cfire at yard                           
OL,6,GFirefighters tackled a blaze affecting 
OL,7,G80 tonnes of metal at a scrapyard.     
OL,9,FCrews spent more than three hours at   
OL,10,Fthe incident in Rectory Road, Little   
OL,11,FThurrock, Essex, on Thursday, having   
OL,12,Fbeen called shortly before 18:10 GMT.  
OL,14,FThey determined the fire was caused by 
OL,15,Fa discarded battery.                   
OL,17,F"This incident highlights how          
OL,18,Fimportant it is to dispose of          
OL,19,Fbatteries properly, not in a skip or   
OL,20,Fwith your general rubbish," station    
OL,21,Fmanager Rick Williams said.            
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
