OL,4,CTown voted most 'dog-friendly' for     
OL,5,Csecond time                            
OL,6,GA Suffolk town has once again been     
OL,7,Gcrowned the most dog-friendly in the   
OL,8,Gcountry.                               
OL,10,FBury St Edmunds came out on top at     
OL,11,Fthis year's DogFriendly Awards after   
OL,12,Fthe public voted it the most           
OL,13,Faccommodating. It also received the    
OL,14,Faward in 2024 and came runner-up in    
OL,15,F2025.                                  
OL,17,FMark Cordell, chief executive of Our   
OL,18,FBury St Edmunds Business Improvement   
OL,19,FDistrict (BID), said the accolade is   
OL,20,F"of huge importance to the visitor     
OL,21,Feconomy in Bury".                      
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
